<title>CHINA: China yuan interbank market to trade on Saturday.</title>
<headline>China yuan interbank market to trade on Saturday.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shanghai-based China's national local currency interbank market will trade this Saturday to compensate for a market holiday next Tuesday to mark the Hong Kong handover, exchange officials said on Friday.</p>
<p>The exchange will be closed from Sunday to Tuesday in celebration of the Chinese takeover of the British colony at midnight on June 30, they said.</p>
